  "description": "Erection of a single storey front extension.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Given its excessive depth, width and location on the principal elevation, the proposed single storey front extension would appear as an overly dominant and incongruous feature to the detriment of the character and appearance of the host property, the row of terrace, and the surrounding area. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the guidance contained in SPD 4 'Design of Residential Extensions' and  SPD 14 'Creating Locally Distinctive Places'."
